  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 94d90c210f499d347ad361f403ad09ab, type: 3}
  m_Name: Sleeper - Musing - Friendly - O1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: DialogueSystem.Runtime::DialogueSystem.DialogueGraph
  nodes:
  - guid: 2fd8c34b-7fea-4105-b5f1-fe5f4c409c53
    kind: 3
    line:
      text: 
      delaySeconds: 1
    editorPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
  - guid: e80c850a-ccaa-4a35-9070-1b334d4041a8
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Sorry for running away on you yesterday.
      delaySeconds: 0.4
    editorPosition: {x: 260, y: 0}
  - guid: 0227076a-85ba-44bb-91c7-2859f8a3b15a
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: All the sudden, the memories, the dreams I've been having... They all fell into place.
      delaySeconds: 2.4
    editorPosition: {x: 520, y: 0}
  - guid: 66a3a670-ead8-4a0e-8b7c-eecc93882cae
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: I remembered what drew me here.
      delaySeconds: 4.1
    editorPosition: {x: 780, y: 0}
  - guid: de24bcf6-a488-485e-b56a-c804f03d5e47
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Your cooking did that!
      delaySeconds: 2.1
    editorPosition: {x: 1040, y: 0}
  - guid: a1ad01c0-9d0a-4b2b-b938-7029a69a9c6d
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: I'm sure everyone who signs their self away to a corporation has a reason to do so. I'm sure my previous self had one too, I don't quite know.
      delaySeconds: 1.8
    editorPosition: {x: 1300, y: 0}
  - guid: 0ed9bfb6-17ce-40e9-99e3-c98b7738fdaa
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: What I do know is that in doing so, my previous self left their mom behind.
      delaySeconds: 6.1
    editorPosition: {x: 1560, y: 0}
  - guid: 01e0a90a-898d-4a2e-8316-40b22a816405
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Left my mom behind. And that's been gnawing at me ever since I opened these synthetic eyes. I just never managed to match the memory to the feeling.
      delaySeconds: 3.7
    editorPosition: {x: 1820, y: 0}
  - guid: d651a9ea-f887-4624-9a38-973026132a9b
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: I wonder what that person I was is feeling right now. Wonder where they are.
      delaySeconds: 6.3
    editorPosition: {x: 2080, y: 0}
  - guid: 4bec3965-65ac-4d09-91c2-3b1908d03d2d
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: Regardless... Thanks to you I was able to reunite with my mother. Start to try and right wrongs I feel like I'd never do.
      delaySeconds: 3.7
    editorPosition: {x: 2340, y: 0}
  - guid: ec421e36-d723-43bf-9d98-bf1a45a3d0cc
    kind: 0
    line:
      text: And I owe you for that opportunity, friend.
      delaySeconds: 5.3
    editorPosition: {x: 2600, y: 0}
  - guid: 34c1905d-dcfe-445c-996e-1844fba84ce6
    kind: 4
    line:
      text: 
      delaySeconds: 1
    editorPosition: {x: 2860, y: 0}
